Nuget CLI commands

# To build
dotnet pack --configuration Release

# To publish -- Replace [PATH_TO_NUPKG] with local path to Release\YOURPACKAGENAME and [YOUR_API_KEY] with Nuget API Key  
dotnet nuget push [PATH_TO_NUPKG] --api-key [YOUR_API_KEY] --source [https://api.nuget.org/v3/index.json](https://api.nuget.org/v3/index.json)
